{"title": "Mage Slayer: Attack Caster", "pageid": 22736, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mage_Slayer:_Attack_Caster", "categories": ["Passive features", "Applies to Wild Shape"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mage_Slayer_Attack_Caster.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Mage_Slayer_Attack_Caster.webp/300px-Mage_Slayer_Attack_Caster.webp, /w/images/d/de/Mage_Slayer_Attack_Caster.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Mage_Slayer_Attack_Caster.webp/300px-Mage_Slayer_Attack_Caster.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Mage_Slayer_Attack_Caster.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Mage Slayer: Attack Caster</b> is a passive feature provided by the <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Slayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mage Slayer\">Mage Slayer</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>. When a creature casts a spell near you, you can attack the caster as a Reaction.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When a creature casts a spell within melee range of you, you can use a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> to immediately make an attack against the caster. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt><dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></span> </dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Slayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mage Slayer\">Mage Slayer</a>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This reaction happens after the spell has been cast.</li>\n<li>This is the only reaction that is unusable while affected by a condition from <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Disguise\" title=\"SG Disguise\">SG_Disguise</a> due to its set <code>EnableCondition</code>. Whether this is an oversight from Patch 8 is unknown, since nearly every other reaction had its <code>EnableCondition</code> field changed at that time.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201411\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 585/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4838/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2809/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 953628/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.981      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   27.981      1 -total\n 27.11%    7.586      1 Template:R\n 15.27%    4.273      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.20%    3.972      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.65%    3.541      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 11.55%    3.233      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  9.87%    2.763      1 Template:InfoBlob\n  8.25%    2.307      1 Template:ResourceList\n  7.16%    2.003      3 Template:IfEmpty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:22736-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201411 and revision id 390878. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}